  * Document preparation and analysis costs
  * Meeting and coordination time savings
- Role-based ROI projections (founder vs investor)
- Milestone-based savings tracking
4. Market Analysis Scoring 
- TAM/SAM/SOM calculation methodology
- Competitive positioning scoring matrix
- Growth trajectory projections with confidence bands
- Industry-specific valuation multiple calculations
5. Investment Terms Analysis
Path: apps/web/src/lib/scoring/dealTerms.ts
